keiko 1
# M1 (release `--dev` on a disposable Slot 1) — the dev shortcuts work: F3
# opens the Monitor, F5 writes manual Slot 1 and F9 loads it.
# Excluded: the release-vs-debug build identity (the case's `dev` header is the
# take's only switch), the real window and physical keys.
dev
setting play.text_speed 0

new-game
expect surface play
press F3
expect monitor open
press Escape
expect monitor closed
press F5
expect slot 1 scene first_meeting
advance
expect line "You're not from around here, are you?"
press F9
expect line "Morning light. A folded letter on the ground, half under a shoe."
